- No Gunbash
- Strength (1)
- Fury (3)
-- 100% faster Resource decay
- 40% less Kb Taken/Given
- 20% slower Skill Cd
- 300% slower Hacking
- Healing (2)
-- Starting HP: 50
- Assemble (3)
- Getup (0)

^3Abilities:
- Lunge (Shoulder Barge) ^3[CS2 Melee]"